{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794468886396,"sessionID":"ses_e3154f688fferuJUyllFRey6r8","part":{"partID":"prt_1ceae34a9001CYt6pgCCO19aHz","sessionID":"ses_e3154f688fferuJUyllFRey6r8","messageID":"msg_1ceae2d17001PtSdH1cKz4gizp","type":"tool","id":"call_00_lz370ppze7vzf66kaeculsl2","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"6. The repository has no root `package.json` and `.skilled/package.json` declares no `scripts` block, so there is no single \"run the tests\" command. Suites are invoked per package, which is why no local aggregate suite cost exists to cut. [SOURCE: .skilled/package.json:1]","oldString":"6. The repository has no root `package.json` and `.skilled/package.json` declares no `scripts` block, so there is no single \"run the tests\" command. Suites are invoked per package, which is why no local aggregate suite cost exists to cut. [SOURCE: .skilled/package.json:1][SOURCE: .gitignore:1]","path":"specs/system-speckit/runtime-and-release/006-test-cycle-speed/007-test-and-ci-bloat-research/research/lineages/opencode-go/iterations/iteration-001.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-speckit/runtime-and-release/006-test-cycle-speed/007-test-and-ci-bloat-research/research/lineages/opencode-go/iterations/iteration-001.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-speckit/runtime-and-release/006-test-cycle-speed/007-test-and-ci-bloat-research/research/lineages/opencode-go/iterations/iteration-001.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-speckit/runtime-and-release/006-test-cycle-speed/007-test-and-ci-bloat-research/research/lineages/opencode-go/iterations/iteration-001.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-speckit/runtime-and-release/006-test-cycle-speed/007-test-and-ci-bloat-research/research/lineages/opencode-go/iterations/iteration-001.md\n+++ specs/system-speckit/runtime-and-release/006-test-cycle-speed/007-test-and-ci-bloat-research/research/lineages/