\nspecs/system-speckit/repo-operations/002-ci-workflow-efficiency/008-consolidation-decision/scratch/d8-answer.md:1:D8=no\nspecs/system-speckit/repo-operations/002-ci-workflow-efficiency/008-consolidation-decision/scratch/no-merge.md:3:D8 = no (`scratch/d8-answer.md`). Both commands were run from the worktree on 2026-10-25 with the phase start SHA `1c317e13c5f54fae965125925b5fb1eea534449e` (`scratch/phase-start-sha.txt`).\nspecs/system-speckit/repo-operations/002-ci-workflow-efficiency/008-consolidation-decision/scratch/phase-result.md:58:## D8\nspecs/system-speckit/repo-operations/002-ci-workflow-efficiency/008-consolidation-decision/scratch/phase-result.md:60:`scratch/d8-answer.md` holds `D8=no`, the session's judgment under the operator's delegation of 2026-10-25, pending the operator's verification at the end of the session. T015 to T020 and T023 are superseded by that answer. `scratch/no-merge.md` holds the empty workflow diff and the empty worktree status.\nspecs/system-speckit/repo-operations/002-ci-workflow-efficiency/008-consolidation-decision/scratch/snapshot-window.md:22:- The gap is recorded, not closed: under the D8 answer `no` the numbers inform the record and gate no file change.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled && grep -rln \\\"fetch-depth\\\" specs/system-speckit/repo-operations/002-ci-workflow-efficiency/*/spec.md 2>/dev/null; echo \\\"=== consolidation decision outcome\\\"; ls specs/system-speckit/repo-operations/002-ci-workflow-efficiency/008-consolidation-decision/scratch/ 2>/dev/null; grep -n \\\"D8\\\" specs/system-speckit/repo-operations/002-ci-workflow-efficiency/008-consolidation-decision/scratch/*.md 2>/dev/null | head -8\"}"},"time":{"start":1794468962272,"end":1794468962961}}}}
