et — exact holdout/bucket counts + release floors\n      13s Local-vs-native divergence ratchet - no unledgered scorer drift\n  JOB 120s Registry == advisor maps; compiled-routing freshness; parent-skill structure\n      55s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      35s Provision the dependency trees the checkers load\n      11s Skill-root metadata class contract — every root, hub or standalone\n### message-contract.yml run=43176912101\n  JOB 78s Commit messages, branch names and PR description follow the templates\n      72s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n### agent-mirror-sync.yml run=40780892829\n  JOB 85s Agent runtime mirrors stay in sync\n      69s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      10s Build the shared package the checker loads\n### skill-advisor-stress.yml run=43168892360\n  JOB 456s Skill advisor stress and default suites\n      61s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      52s Install and build the advisor runtime and what its stress suite loads\n      27s Run the stress suite\n      309s Run the default suite\n### deep-loop-runtime.yml run=43174399019\n  JOB 395s Deep-loop runtime vitest suites\n      56s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      28s Install the deep-loop runtime and the shared package it links\n      306s Run the deep-loop runtime suites\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### comment-hygiene.yml run=42796769476\n  JOB 92s No ephemeral-artifact pointers in code comments\n      87s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n### naming-standard-guard.yml run=43176911930\n  JOB 88s Enforce kebab-case filesystem names\n      72s Checkout full history\n### routing-registry-drift.yml run=43174399109\n  JOB 136s Gate-2 golden prompts — real scorer top-1/top-3 + joined compiled mode\n      58s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      38s Provision the dependency trees the golden-prompt gate loads\n      13s Scorer-eval baseline ratchet — exact holdout/bucket counts + release floors\n      13s Local-vs-native divergence ratchet - no unledgered scorer drift\n  JOB 120s Registry == advisor maps; compiled-routing freshness; parent-skill structure\n      55s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      35s Provision the dependency trees the checkers load\n      11s Skill-root metadata class contract — every root, hub or standalone\n### message-contract.yml run=43176912101\n  JOB 78s Commit messages, branch names and PR description follow the templates\n      72s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n### agent-mirror-sync.yml run=40780892829\n  JOB 85s Agent runtime mirrors stay in sync\n      69s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      10s Build the shared package the checker loads\n### skill-advisor-stress.yml run=43168892360\n  JOB 456s Skill advisor stress and default suites\n      61s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      52s Install and build the advisor runtime and what its stress suite loads\n      27s Run the stress suite\n      309s Run the default suite\n### deep-loop-runtime.yml run=43174399019\n  JOB 395s Deep-loop runtime vitest suites\n      56s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      28s Install the deep-loop runtime and the shared package it links\n      306s Run the deep-loop runtime suites\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled && for wf in comment-hygiene.yml naming-standard-guard.yml routing-registry-drift.yml message-contract.yml agent-mirror-sync.yml skill-advisor-stress.yml deep-loop-runtime.yml; do id=$(gh run list --workflow=$wf --status success --limit 1 --json databaseId 2>/dev/null | node -e 'let d=\\\"\\\";process.stdin.on(\\\"data\\\",c=>d+=c).on(\\\"end\\\",()=>{try{const j=JSON.parse(d);process.stdout.write(String(j[0]?j[0].databaseId:\\\"\\\"))}catch(e){}})'); if [ -z \\\"$id\\\" ]; then echo \\\"### $wf NO_RUN\\\"; continue; fi; echo \\\"### $wf run=$id\\\"; gh run view \\\"$id\\\" --json jobs 2>/dev/null | node -e 'let d=\\\"\\\";process.stdin.on(\\\"data\\\",c=>d+=c).on(\\\"end\\\",()=>{const j=JSON.parse(d);for(const job of j.jobs){const tot=(new Date(job.completedAt)-new Date(job.startedAt))/1000;console.log(\\\"  JOB\\\",tot+\\\"s\\\",job.name);for(const s of job.steps||[]){const dur=(new Date(s.completedAt)-new Date(s.startedAt))/1000;if(dur>=10)console.log(\\\"     \\\",dur+\\\"s\\\",s.name);}}})'; done\", \"timeout\": 180000}"},"time":{"start":1794469470786,"end":1794469486061}}}}
