  JOB 32s Push the trigger index rebuild\n      25s Check out the base commit\n### opencode-dual-version.yml run=43172983998\n  JOB 135s Battery on OpenCode v1\n      60s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      37s Provision the dependency trees the plugins import\n      19s Run the config-shape, battery and cli-opencode doc unit tests\n  JOB 147s Both versions installed at once\n      59s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      47s Provision the dependency trees the plugins import\n      16s Install both versions into their own prefixes\n      17s Run the version battery against both installs\n  JOB 158s Battery on OpenCode v2\n      64s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      49s Provision the dependency trees the plugins import\n      19s Run the config-shape, battery and cli-opencode doc unit tests\n      10s Run the version battery for v2\n### command-tree-parity.yml run=43177390691\n  JOB 90s OpenCode and Claude command trees stay identical\n      57s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      26s Install the spec-kit workspace\n  JOB 121s DSH skill, agent and prompt mirrors match their sources\n      63s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      42s Install the spec-kit workspace\n### playbook-operator-contract.yml run=43177390587\n  JOB 93s Manual-testing-playbook operator-scenario contract\n      52s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      31s Install the spec-kit workspace and build its shared package\n### changed-packet-validation.yml run=43177390642\n  JOB 129s Spec packets touched by this PR validate clean\n      79s Run actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1\n      45s Install spec-kit dependencies\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### gate-inputs.yml run=43177390580\n  JOB 170