"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\ntitle: \"Research: Test and CI bloat — what to delete, merge, narrow or move\"\ndescription: \"Ranked, evidence-backed cuts to test, workflow and hook run time for the opencode-go lineage of phase 007.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"test and ci bloat research\"\n  - \"which tests and workflows to cut\"\n  - \"shorten commit and push run time\"\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: research\n---\n\n# Research: Test and CI bloat\n...\n14:## 1. Short Answer\n22:## 2. What Was Checked\n31:## 3. The Five Largest Measured Costs\n43:## 4. Recommendations\n61:## 5. Why the Hook Path Is Not the Problem\n67:## 6. What the Duplicates Actually Duplicate\n79:## 7. Test-Surface Findings That Change the Census\n87:## 8. What Cannot Be Fixed by Cutting Checks\n91:## 9. Eliminated Alternatives\n103:## 10. Divergence Map\n111:## 11. Open Questions\n117:## 12. References\n126:## Appendix: Convergence Report\n=== dashboard head\n---\ntitle: Deep Research Dashboard\ndescription: Auto-generated reducer view over the research packet.\n---\n\n# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n\nAuto-generated from JSONL state log, iteration files, findings registry, and strategy state. Never manually edited.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:overview -->\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled && L=\\\"specs/system-speckit/runtime-and-release/006-test-cycle-speed/007-test-and-ci-bloat-research/research/lineages/opencode-go\\\" && head -12 \\\"$L/research.md\\\"; echo \\\"...\\\"; grep -n \\\"^## \\\" \\\"$L/research.md\\\"; echo \\\"=== dashboard head\\\"; head -12 \\\"$L/deep-research-dashboard.md\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794469857567,"end":1794469858348}}}}
